<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to October 23, of shipments (1995/96 except for sunseed), export commitments (1995/96) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  4,046.1  4,100.0   Dec-Nov	4,796.9   1155.8</p>
<p> Maize	  5,181.7  6,400.0   Mar-Feb	6,313.8    389.5</p>
<p> Sorghum	  646.1    650.0   Mar-Feb	  634.3     13.9</p>
<p> Soybeans     1,987.8  2,100.0   Apr-Mar	2,130.7    411.2</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 540.6    600.0   Jan-Dec	  577.4     12.0</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541-318-0655</p>
